sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Ag as Agent
    participant GW as Ingest
    participant Sh as Shard
    participant Hot as Hot tier
    participant Cold as Downsampled tier
    participant Q as Query
    Ag->>GW: pre-aggregated points
    GW->>Sh: route by series hash
    Sh->>Sh: reject new series past the cardinality budget
    Note over Sh: cardinality, not volume, is what kills a metrics system
    Sh->>Hot: Gorilla-compressed, full resolution
    Hot->>Cold: roll up as it ages
    Q->>Hot: recent, fine-grained
    Q->>Cold: historical, coarse
    Cold-->>Q: enough resolution for the pixels being drawn
